6
01:06:50.970 --> 01:06:51.970
De Hamond.

7
01:06:51.970 --> 01:06:52.970
De Hamond ?

8
01:06:52.970 --> 01:06:53.970
Oui.

9
01:06:53.970 --> 01:06:54.970
